00:03:07.453 --> 00:03:11.157
- Congratulations
Congratulations on your act

00:03:11.157 --> 00:03:12.391
You know, when you
were singing there

00:03:12.391 --> 00:03:14.961
I was thinking
years and years ago

00:03:14.961 --> 00:03:16.529
when my daughter
was going to UCLA

00:03:16.529 --> 00:03:19.232
I called up your father
Frank and asked him

00:03:19.232 --> 00:03:20.366
if he'd go over to UCLA

00:03:20.366 --> 00:03:23.236
and appear at an affair for her

00:03:23.236 --> 00:03:24.470
and Frank has often told me

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:26.072
that she was standing
there reading, you know

00:03:26.072 --> 00:03:28.608
